# Keep the build context source-only — deps, build output, and instance state
# are rebuilt/created inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.nuxt
.git
.github
# Instance runtime state (must never leak into an image):
.system-data
data
deploy/secrets
deploy/certs
# Misc
**/*.log
.env
# Local temp verification scripts (never in the image)
/_verify-ui.cjs
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
